rgb(204, 204, 204);\">7A抗菌、高吸水、不易掉毛</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\">适用场景</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\">居家洗漱、健身、旅行出差</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h3>📦购买须知</h3><p>1. 新毛巾初次使用建议清水漂洗一遍，去除浮毛</p><p>2. 建议通风晾干，避免长期密闭潮湿存放，延长使用寿命</p><p>3. 请勿使用高温漂白剂清洗，防止面料损伤</p><p><br></p><p><em>温馨提示：有多款颜色可选，下单如有颜色需求可咨询客服。</em></p>','/uploads/2026-08-01/9440dce2-ba39-4b26-80e0-715f1308f254.jpg',1,'2026-08-01 09:53:44','2026-08-25 17:35:00',0,4,30),(24,'夏季薄款垂坠感韩版宽松休闲显瘦扎染五分裤篮球跑步直筒运动裤','xia ji bao kuan chui zhui gan han ban kuan song xiu xian xian shou za ran wu fen ku lan qiu pao bu zhi tong yun dong ku',4,4,43.90,298,'<p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br></p><blockquote style=\"text-align: start;\">垂感·自在<br><strong>韩版宽松五分裤</strong><br>一穿上身，垂坠有型<br>告别闷热，整个夏天轻盈到底</blockquote><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/f3cb1cf1-a0d5-4c12-bc75-f90c588dcd1c.jpg\" alt=\"男裤1.jpg\" data-href=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/f3cb1cf1-a0d5-4c12-bc75-f90c588dcd1c.jpg\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;\"></p><blockquote style=\"text-align: start;\">穿搭场景<br>🏀 <strong>篮球场上</strong>：搭配运动背心 + 球鞋，挥洒汗水不束缚<br>🛹 <strong>街头出街</strong>：搭配宽松T恤 + 板鞋，美式复古感拉满<br>☕ <strong>日常通勤</strong>：搭配纯色衬衫 + 帆布鞋，松弛感拿捏到位<br>🏖️ <strong>夏日度假</strong>：搭配短袖衬衫 + 凉拖，清爽又上镜</blockquote><p><img src=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/798cb3b2-7334-4fb1-844c-7fd3355b6567.jpg\" alt=\"男裤2.jpg\" data-href=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/798cb3b2-7334-4fb1-844c-7fd3355b6567.jpg\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/99ad354b-a204-4b2f-9c18-069556b0fc59.jpg\" alt=\"男裤4.jpg\" data-href=\"/uploads/2026-08-21/99ad354b-a204-4b2f-9c18-069556b0fc59.jpg\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 100%;\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','/uploads/2026-08-21/0051fc01-6d23-468f-9b15-2468901a0c09.jpg',1,'2026-08-21 10:46:32','2026-08-27 11:35:00',0,2,13);
